{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1792503930071,"sessionID":"ses_ea67781bcffe0HPBy9O3ZA3rA8","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"todowrite","callID":"chatcmpl-tool-8e3d27c02ad06f41","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"todos":[{"content":"Understand verifier, offline baseline, and work_ratio mechanics","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement candidate: maintain ordering + adjacency bitmasks, validate via (LB) 4-point property, recompute only when invalidated","status":"in_progress","priority":"high"},{"content":"Run checks (max 8) until search-level PASS with low work_ratio","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Run final check and finish","status":"pending","priority":"high"}]},"output":"[\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Understand verifier, offline baseline, and work_ratio mechanics\",\n    \"status\": \"completed\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Implement candidate: maintain ordering + adjacency bitmasks, validate via (LB) 4-point property, recompute only when invalidated\",\n    \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Run checks (max 8) until search-level PASS with low work_ratio\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Run final check and finish\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  }\n]","metadata":{"todos":[{"content":"Understand verifier, offline baseline, and work_ratio mechanics","status":"completed","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement candidate: maintain ordering + adjacency bitmasks, validate via (LB) 4-point property, recompute only when invalidated","status":"in_progress","priority":"high"},{"content":"Run checks (max 8) until search-level PASS with low work_ratio","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Run final check and finish","status":"pending","priority":"high"}],"truncated":false},"title":"3 todos","time":{"start":1792503930040,"end":1792503930054}},"id":"prt_1598f57e1001k3MxVVhFPzue7G","sessionID":"ses_ea67781bcffe0HPBy9O3ZA3rA8","messageID":"msg_1598b7241001pCebZzI9fyi403"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1792503930071,"sessionID":"ses_ea67781bcffe0HPBy9O3ZA3rA8","part":{"id":"prt_1598f53ed001FmqC4OyzWVmLu7","messageID":"msg_1598b7241001pCebZzI9fyi403","sessionID":"ses_ea67781bcffe0HPBy9O3ZA3rA8","type":"text","text":"\n\nThe verifier accepts any valid LexBFS ordering (any start, any tie-break), certified by the (LB) 4-point property. The offline baseline is a naive O(n²) partition-refinement in Python with set/list ops. My plan: maintain the ordering + adjacency bitmasks, validate via the 4-point property with bitmasks (cheap), and only recompute when the ordering is invalidated. Let me set up a todo list and implement.\n\n","time":{"start":1792503927789,"end":1792503930060}}}
